The public group contains the options, successful plan, and structured
failures. The planning function itself appears in Presentation, after all of
its operations have acquired a concrete meaning.

--- Weaver public results
@{Weave options}
@{Weave plan}
@{Weave plan failures}
@{Weave errors}
